    {
      "zh": "133120 总窗口下实测 8 条满长请求同时驻留、零抢占。约 128K 前缀的冷 TTFT 为 14.636 秒，热组中位数 0.771 秒；缓存条件不同。",
      "en": "Eight full-window requests resided concurrently without preemption at a 133,120-token total window. At approximately 128K prefix, cold TTFT was 14.636 s and warm median 0.771 s under different cache conditions."
    }
